  "name": "Application Mapping: HEM Heterogeneity Taxonomy × DIO Reconstruction Consequences",
  "description": "A derived analytical mapping between heterogeneity conditions identified in Heterogeneous Entity Matching (HEM) and possible DIO reconstruction consequences. It does not assert taxonomic equivalence or deterministic causality.",
